{"id":"n37609-2-22","stage":3,"title":"책임 · 责任","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37609-2-22-1","ko":"저는 이번 사고와 직접적인 관련이 없습니다.","zh":"我和这次事故没有直接关系。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사고와","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직접적인","meaning":"直接的","explanation":"직접적：直接的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"직접적","audio":"/audio/8270980d30860ac5e429.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28962","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관련이","meaning":"相关，关连，关系","explanation":"관련：相关，关连，关系；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관련","audio":"/audio/cf097508fb67e2c501d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30305","senseId":"1","lemma":"관련","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없습니다.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"14","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"8270980d30860ac5","term":"직접적","zh":"直接的","audio":"/audio/8270980d30860ac5e429.mp3","entryId":"28962","definition":"不通过第三者，而是直连的。","pronunciation":["직쩝쩍"]},{"id":"cf097508fb67e2c5","term":"관련","zh":"相关，关连，关系","audio":"/audio/cf097508fb67e2c501d1.mp3","entryId":"30305","definition":"两个以上的人、事物、现象等建立联系，相互影响；或指其关系。","pronunciation":["괄련"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不成立理由或可能性。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/66f0b541bd3049453a13.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37609-2-22-2","ko":"그렇게 책임을 회피하시면 안 됩니다.","zh":"您不能这样逃避责任。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책임을","meaning":"责任","explanation":"책임：责任；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책임","audio":"/audio/d9e8885b1d9be68bef6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37609","senseId":"2","lemma":"책임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회피하시면","meaning":"回避，逃避","explanation":"회피하다：回避，逃避；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"회피하다","audio":"/audio/c1592d18ad14064a9cc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90085","senseId":"2","lemma":"회피하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됩니다.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d9e8885b1d9be68b","term":"책임","zh":"责任","audio":"/audio/d9e8885b1d9be68bef6c.mp3","entryId":"37609","definition":"因某种事情的结果而所应承担的义务、负担，或相应的处分。","pronunciation":["채김"]},{"id":"c1592d18ad14064a","term":"회피하다","zh":"回避，逃避","audio":"/audio/c1592d18ad14064a9cc0.mp3","entryId":"90085","definition":"避而不去承担责任。","pronunciation":["회피하다","훼피하다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe7ee9b2b7070787c812.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37609","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您不能这样逃避责任。","我和这次事故没有直接关系。","请给我一条铺在地板上的毯子。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我和这次事故没有直接关系。","请给我一条铺在地板上的毯子。","您不能这样逃避责任。"],"answer":2}]}
